wisnuj6-dmWAxUcADQIHcuFPNEQ3IcHCFAoEg",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_NOISE_LEVEL"],"你覺得吵雜程度如何？",[[[["E:DINING_NOISE_LEVEL_QUIET"],"安靜，適合交談",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwisnuj6-dmWAxUcADQIHcuFPNEQ3YcHCFMoAA"]],1],null,null,"吵雜程度",null,"0ahUKEwisnuj6-dmWAxUcADQIHcuFPNEQ3IcHCFIoEw",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_SEATING_TYPE"],"可選擇哪些類型的座位？",null,[[[["E:DINING_SEATING_TYPE_INDOOR_DINING_AREA"],"室內用餐區",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwisnuj6-dmWAxUcADQIHcuFPNEQ3YcHCFUoAA"],[["E:DINING_SEATING_TYPE_COUNTER_SEATING"],"吧台座位",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwisnuj6-dmWAxUcADQIHcuFPNEQ3YcHCFYoAQ"]]],null,"座位類型",null,"0ahUKEwisnuj6-dmWAxUcADQIHcuFPNEQ3IcHCFQoFA",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["🍜士林捷運站附近的拉麵店。\n\n👍優點：\n1. 價格便宜，目前（2026.6月）不用200元就能吃一碗、還能免費加麵一次。\n2. 麵體和湯頭都不錯。\n\n☹️：\n份量很小一碗，雞叉燒不好吃。\n\n🌟餐點：\n這次吃「黃金雞湯拉麵」，麵體選粗麵，免費續麵一律是細麵，因此剛好粗細兩種麵都有吃到。\n麵體算是很不錯，我個人偏好粗麵，這家的粗麵口感很不錯，Q彈且軟硬適中。不過細麵也蠻好吃的，本來看到細麵的樣子覺得應該很普，但比想像中要有嚼勁，口感也不差。\n內容物有叉燒（有一片豬叉燒、三片雞叉燒）、半顆溏心蛋、高麗菜、蔥花。\n叉燒部分，豬叉燒有炙烤過，味道很讚；雞叉燒比較普通，而且還帶有些腥味。\n雞湯的湯頭很順口好喝。\n不過份量比預期中小不少，碗的深度很淺，雖然價格也很便宜就是了。\n\n🌟服務、環境：\n環境不錯，簡單乾淨。\n不過點餐時有跟店員說不要加蔥花，最後上餐還是加了蔥花… 😅",null,[0,19]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/10860335556833949466/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRPTTA5VlRrNU9hbXhPVjI1V1NGTXdlRzlOUkZaVFlsVk9NRk13UlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/10860335556833949466/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRPTTA5VlRrNU9hbXhPVjI1V1NGTXdlRzlOUkZaVFlsVk9NRk13UlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/10860335556833949466/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRPTTA5VlRrNU9hbXhPVjI1V1NGTXdlRzlOUkZaVFlsVk9NRk13UlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/10860335556833949466/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRPTTA5VlRrNU9hbXhPVjI1V1NGTXdlRzlOUkZaVFlsVk9NRk13UlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.c