"],"你覺得吵雜程度如何？",[[[["E:DINING_NOISE_LEVEL_LOUD"],"吵雜，但還是能交談",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwisnuj6-dmWAxUcADQIHcuFPNEQ3YcHCMEBKAA"]],1],null,null,"吵雜程度",null,"0ahUKEwisnuj6-dmWAxUcADQIHcuFPNEQ3IcHCMABKAc",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["先說我不是托，但百八龍是少有的能在全面漲價中降價的，原200~220的麵現在均一185，就這點我給他五星好評不過分。\n環境方面：室內採用小燈照明，偏暗，溫馨風，座位是有的但約半數是吧台，好不好坐看人。\n餐品方面：我吃過三次左右，雞湯雖說是招牌但我印象確實不深，辛拉麵則是正常的豚骨+辛辣醬，以185元cp值是水準之上。\n個人體驗：服務員熱情，可再加一次麵（但她好像沒讓我選粗細也不曉得是不是忘了），cp值相比動輒260以上的拉麵可以了，要更低價只能去九湯屋那種調製的了。",null,[0,235]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/10860335556833949466/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFhYWxaWGJFOWFWelZZWW1wS1ZVOVdiRE5OTUhNMVZHNUtOR0ZyUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/10860335556833949466/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFhYWxaWGJFOWFWelZZWW1wS1ZVOVdiRE5OTUhNMVZHNUtOR0ZyUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/10860335556833949466/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFhYWxaWGJFOWFWelZZWW1wS1ZVOVdiRE5OTUhNMVZHNUtOR0ZyUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/10860335556833949466/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFhYWxaWGJFOWFWelZZWW1wS1ZVOVdiRE5OTUhNMVZHNUtOR0ZyUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/10860335556833949466/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFhYWxaWGJFOWFWelZZWW1wS1ZVOVdiRE5OTUhNMVZHNUtOR0ZyUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/10860335556833949466/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFhYWxaWGJFOWFWelZZWW1wS1ZVOVdiRE5OTUhNMVZHNUtOR0ZyUlJBQhAA"]],[null,null,2139,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT21aalZXbE9aVzVYYmpKVU9WbDNNMHM1VG5KNGFrRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x1ac127b406c295b2!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOmZjVWlOZW5XbjJUOVl3M0s5TnJ4akE%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com